# NOTE: git treats `#` as a comment ONLY at the start of a line. A trailing "# ..." after a
# pattern becomes part of the pattern and silently breaks it — keep comments on their own lines.

# --- Terraform ---
# provider plugins / modules (machine-local, large)
.terraform/
# state never in git (secrets in plaintext); it lives in S3
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
# may hold secrets / per-env values
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (pins provider versions) — not ignored.

# --- Helm ---
# Vendored subcharts pulled by `helm dependency build/update` into a parent chart's charts/.
# The SOURCE charts (e.g. charts/mongodb/) are committed; the vendored copies are not.
charts/*/charts/
*.tgz
# NOTE: Chart.lock IS committed (pins resolved dependency versions) — not ignored.

# --- Local / OS / IDE ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
kubeconfig
*.log
EKS_Cluster_Learning_Plan_v2.md
